752:  /// Applies one resolved restore binding: builds the model, re-pins the
753:  /// active custom entry (its key slot then serves the model), re-points
754:  /// the stream wiring (roles mode re-pins the default chain — the same
755:  /// wiring a live provider switch builds; the legacy path rebuilds the
756:  /// direct stream function), and records the binding back into the
757:  /// session. Best-effort: an unresolvable provider keeps the current
758:  /// model with a note.
759:  Future<void> _applyRestoredModelBinding(
760:    Session session, {
